<p>Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</p>

<p>I hope your fall's going well! My name is Caroline, I'm an Account Executive representing a few different strategy-based programs over here at EverQuote. As we navigate the slower holiday months and start thinking about prepping for the new year, I was hoping to connect about your growth plans and current marketing set-up to gauge the fit of a partnership.&nbsp;</p>

<p>We're currently seeing a healthy volume of quote requests in your area and would love to help formulate a plan around achieving your Q1 goals - the best time to strategize is now so we have everything running effectively by the new year!</p>

<p>Do you have some time to connect this week?<br />
<br />
I've attached a link to my calendar <a href="https://calendar.app.google/ivyUeimaJjgaDbqv7">here</a> and look forward to hearing from you. In the meantime, please feel free to also check out our agent <a href="https://resources.everquote.com/">resource page</a>&nbsp;that&nbsp;shares best practices, testimonials and other materials to maximize agency success.</p>

<p>All the best,</p>

<p>Caroline&nbsp;</p>
